"![Code output](/img/workshop/04-hands-on-introduction-to-"
"qiskit/output_8.png)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Create the second Bell state\n"
msgstr "第2ベル状態を作成します\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "$$ |\\phi^- \\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt 2}(|00 \\rangle - |11 \\rangle) $$\n"
msgstr "$$ |\\phi^- \\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt 2}(|00 \\rangle - |11 \\rangle) $$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/workshop/04-hands-on-introduction-to-"
"qiskit/output_9.png)\n"
