"![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/workshop/04-hands-on-introduction-to-"
"qiskit/output_9.png)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The explanation is that:\n"
"$$\n"
"H|1\\rangle=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2} }(|0\\rangle-|1\\rangle) = |-\\rangle \n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"説明は以下の通りです：\n"
"$$\n"
"H|1\\rangle=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2} }(|0\\rangle-|1\\rangle) = |-\\rangle \n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
